message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated article and this repository."
title: "PRIVER: Prompt-Stable Reciprocal Inter-scale Visual Evidence Reranking"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/izillionways/PRIVER"
authors:
  - family-names: Shen
    given-names: Zhengwei
    email: zwshen@zju.edu.cn
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7816-5081"
abstract: >-
  A training-free method for reranking within-image evidence patches in
  high-resolution remote-sensing imagery using prompt stability,
  same-scale spatial support, and reciprocal inter-scale support.
keywords:
  - remote sensing
  - vision-language retrieval
  - patch retrieval
  - reranking
